th-inline\" data-tex=\"0\\leq\\kappa\\leq\\omega_1\">\\(0\\leq\\kappa\\leq\\omega_1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U_\\kappa,\\mathcal L_\\kappa^{\\mathrm{op}},\\mathcal L_\\kappa\">\\(\\mathcal U_\\kappa,\\mathcal L_\\kappa^{\\mathrm{op}},\\mathcal L_\\kappa\\)</span> 及其带标签构造子见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"286b4fb3f5242f4f\" href=\"?note=286b4fb3f5242f4f\" title=\"18-df-infinitary-language\">18-df-infinitary-language</a>。算术原子的对偶 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sim_{\\mathrm N}\">\\(\\sim_{\\mathrm N}\\)</span>、闭项集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CT}_{\\mathrm{NT}}\">\\(\\mathrm{CT}_{\\mathrm{NT}}\\)</span>、闭项值 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{val}\">\\(\\operatorname{val}\\)</span> 和数项代入见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"7ddb1b71680edcd2\" href=\"?note=7ddb1b71680edcd2\" title=\"18-df-arithmetic-tait-language\">18-df-arithmetic-tait-language</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in A_{\\mathrm{NT}}\">\\(A\\in A_{\\mathrm{NT}}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathcal V\">\\(x\\in\\mathcal V\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_{\\mathrm{NT}}\">\\(t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_{\\mathrm{NT}}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CS}_\\infty,\\sim_\\infty,\\mathrm{rnk}_\\infty\">\\(\\mathrm{CS}_\\infty,\\sim_\\infty,\\mathrm{rnk}_\\infty\\)</span> 和模板代入按带标签良基树递归；空序列的域是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>，空上确界是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Diag}_\\infty\">\\(\\mathrm{Diag}_\\infty\\)</span> 是下式定义的标准数值原子图。类型集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CType}_\\kappa,\\mathrm{DType}_\\kappa\">\\(\\mathrm{CType}_\\kappa,\\mathrm{DType}_\\kappa\\)</span> 只分类闭数变量的公式。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{CS}_\\infty(\\mathsf a(A))&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathrm{CS}_\\infty(\\mathsf C_\\lambda(\\vec F))&amp;\\coloneqq\\vec F,\\\\\n\\mathrm{CS}_\\infty(\\mathsf D_\\lambda(\\vec F))&amp;\\coloneqq\\vec F,\\\\\n\\sim_\\infty\\mathsf a(A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf a(\\sim_{\\mathrm N}A),\\\\\n\\sim_\\infty\\mathsf C_\\lambda(\\vec F)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\mathsf D_\\lambda(\\langle\\sim_\\infty F_\\xi\\mid\\xi&lt;\\lambda\\rangle),\\\\\n\\sim_\\infty\\mathsf D_\\lambda(\\vec F)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\mathsf C_\\lambda(\\langle\\sim_\\infty F_\\xi\\mid\\xi&lt;\\lambda\\rangle),\\\\\n\\mathrm{rnk}_\\infty(\\mathsf a(A))&amp;\\coloneqq0,\\\\\n\\mathrm{rnk}_\\infty(\\mathsf C_\\lambda(\\vec F))&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\sup\\{\\mathrm{rnk}_\\infty(F_\\xi)+1\\mid\\xi&lt;\\lambda\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{rnk}_\\infty(\\mathsf D_\\lambda(\\vec F))&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\sup\\{\\mathrm{rnk}_\\infty(F_\\xi)+1\\mid\\xi&lt;\\lambda\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{CS}_\\infty(\\mathsf a(A))&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathrm{CS}_\\infty(\\mathsf C_\\lambda(\\vec F))&amp;\\coloneqq\\vec F,\\\\\n\\mathrm{CS}_\\infty(\\mathsf D_\\lambda(\\vec F))&amp;\\coloneqq\\vec F,\\\\\n\\sim_\\infty\\mathsf a(A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf a(\\sim_{\\mathrm N}A),\\\\\n\\sim_\\infty\\mathsf C_\\lambda(\\vec F)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\mathsf D_\\lambda(\\langle\\sim_\\infty F_\\xi\\mid\\xi&lt;\\lambda\\rangle),\\\\\n\\sim_\\infty\\mathsf D_\\lambda(\\vec F)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\mathsf C_\\lambda(\\langle\\sim_\\infty F_\\xi\\mid\\xi&lt;\\lambda\\rangle),\\\\\n\\mathrm{rnk}_\\infty(\\mathsf a(A))&amp;\\coloneqq0,\\\\\n\\mathrm{rnk}_\\infty(\\mathsf C_\\lambda(\\vec F))&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\sup\\{\\mathrm{rnk}_\\infty(F_\\xi)+1\\mid\\xi&lt;\\lambda\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{rnk}_\\infty(\\mathsf D_\\lambda(\\vec F))&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\sup\\{\\mathrm{rnk}_\\infty(F_\\xi)+1\\mid\\xi&lt;\\lambda\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf a(A)[x:=t]_\\infty&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf a(A[x:=t]),\\\\\n\\mathsf C_\\lambda(\\vec F)[x:=t]_\\infty&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\mathsf C_\\lambda(\\langle F_\\xi[x:=t]_\\infty\\mid\\xi&lt;\\lambda\\rangle),\\\\\n\\mathsf D_\\lambda(\\vec F)[x:=t]_\\infty&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\mathsf D_\\lambda(\\langle F_\\xi[x:=t]_\\infty\\mid\\xi&lt;\\lambda\\rangle).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf a(A)[x:=t]_\\infty&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf a(A[x:=t]),\\\\\n\\mathsf C_\\lambda(\\vec F)[x:=t]_\\infty&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\mathsf C_\\lambda(\\langle F_\\xi[x:=t]_\\infty\\mid\\xi&lt;\\lambda\\rangle),\\\\\n\\mathsf D_\\lambda(\\vec F)[x:=t]_\\infty&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\mathsf D_\\lambda(\\langle F_\\xi[x:=t]_\\infty\\mid\\xi&lt;\\lambda\\rangle).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Diag}_\\infty&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{\\mathsf a(s=t)\\mid s,t\\in\\mathrm{CT}_{\\mathrm{NT}},\\ \\operatorname{val}(s)=\\operatorname{val}(t)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{\\mathsf a(s\\ne t)\\mid s,t\\in\\mathrm{CT}_{\\mathrm{NT}},\\ \\operatorname{val}(s)\\ne\\operatorname{val}(t)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{CType}_\\kappa&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Diag}_\\infty\\cup\n\\{\\mathsf C_\\lambda(\\vec F)\\in\\mathcal L_\\kappa\\mid\\lambda&lt;\\kappa\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{DType}_\\kappa&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{\\sim_\\infty F\\mid F\\in\\mathrm{Diag}_\\infty\\}\\cup\n\\{\\mathsf D_\\lambda(\\vec F)\\in\\mathcal L_\\kappa\\mid\\lambda&lt;\\kappa\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Diag}_\\infty&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{\\mathsf a(s=t)\\mid s,t\\in\\mathrm{CT}_{\\mathrm{NT}},\\ \\operatorname{val}(s)=\\operatorname{val}(t)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{\\mathsf a(s\\ne t)\\mid s,t\\in\\mathrm{CT}_{\\mathrm{NT}},\\ \\operatorname{val}(s)\\ne\\operatorname{val}(t)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{CType}_\\kappa&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Diag}_\\infty\\cup\n\\{\\mathsf C_\\lambda(\\vec F)\\in\\mathcal L_\\kappa\\mid\\lambda&lt;\\kappa\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{DType}_\\kappa&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{\\sim_\\infty F\\mid F\\in\\mathrm{Diag}_\\infty\\}\\cup\n\\{\\mathsf D_\\lambda(\\vec F)\\in\\mathcal L_\\kappa\\mid\\lambda&lt;\\kappa\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall F\\in\\mathcal L_\\kappa^{\\mathrm{op}}\\quad\n\\bigl(\\sim_\\infty F\\in\\mathcal L_\\kappa^{\\mathrm{op}}\\land\n\\sim_\\infty\\sim_\\infty F=F\\land\n\\mathrm{rnk}_\\infty(F)&lt;\\omega_1\\land\n\\mathrm{rnk}_\\infty(\\sim_\\infty F)=\\mathrm{rnk}_\\infty(F)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall F\\in\\mathcal L_\\kappa^{\\mathrm{op}}\\quad\n\\bigl(\\sim_\\infty F\\in\\mathcal L_\\kappa^{\\mathrm{op}}\\land\n\\sim_\\infty\\sim_\\infty F=F\\land\n\\mathrm{rnk}_\\infty(F)&lt;\\omega_1\\land\n\\mathrm{rnk}_\\infty(\\sim_\\infty F)=\\mathrm{rnk}_\\infty(F)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall F\\in\\mathcal L_\\kappa^{\\mathrm{op}}\\quad\n\\bigl(F[x:=t]_\\infty\\in\\mathcal L_\\kappa^{\\mathrm{op}}\\land\n\\mathrm{rnk}_\\infty(F[x:=t]_\\infty)=\\mathrm{rnk}_\\infty(F)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall F\\in\\mathcal L_\\kappa^{\\mathrm{op}}\\quad\n\\bigl(F[x:=t]_\\infty\\in\\mathcal L_\\kappa^{\\mathrm{op}}\\land\n\\mathrm{rnk}_\\infty(F[x:=t]_\\infty)=\\mathrm{rnk}_\\infty(F)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>构造子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf C_\\lambda(\\vec F),\\mathsf D_\\lambda(\\vec F)\">\\(\\mathsf C_\\lambda(\\vec F),\\mathsf D_\\lambda(\\vec F)\\)</span> 与类型集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CType}_\\kappa,\\mathrm{DType}_\\kappa\">\\(\\mathrm{CType}_\\kappa,\\mathrm{DType}_\\kappa\\)</span> 使用不同名称，避免有限 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> 时同一记号同时作函数和集合。类型、特征序列与对偶对应 Definition 8.1.1，秩对应 Definition 8.3.1；这里的序数秩用上确界，而非旧有限语法节点 034 的逻辑符号总数。数变量模板没有量词绑定，代入逐分支降到原子，所以不出现捕获问题。类型只在闭数公式中判定，不能为开放模板的数值原子暗中选择数赋值。</p>\n<p>构造子互斥且子代码集合秩下降，所有递归唯一。对代码归纳证明双对偶、代入保持秩及有限支持；秩的每个上确界只取可数多个可数序数，因此仍小于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega_1\">\\(\\omega_1\\)</span>。空合取属于合取类型且秩为 0，空析取属于析取类型且秩为 0；集成员原子不属于任一类型。这些边界均与原书规则一致。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"18-df-infinitary-language","status":"resolved","id":"286b4fb3f5242f4f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-infinitary-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-arithmetic-tait-language","status":"resolved","id":"7ddb1b71680edcd2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-arithmetic-tait-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-infinitary-language","status":"resolved","id":"286b4fb3f5242f4f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$0\\leq\\kappa\\leq\\omega_1$，$\\mathcal U_\\kappa,\\mathcal L_\\kappa^{\\mathrm{op}},\\mathcal L_\\kappa$ 及其带标签构造子见 [[18-df-infinitary-language]]。算术原子的对偶 $\\sim_{\\mathrm N}$、闭项集 $\\mathrm{CT}_{\\mathrm{NT}}$、闭项值 $\\operatorname{val}$ 和数项代入见 [[18-df-arithmetic-tait-language]]。$A\\in A_{\\mathrm{NT}}$，$x\\in\\mathcal V$，$t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_{\\mat